<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Many of the images are old and some were not captured properly, and many of them have issues like noise or unsharp or low-quality It causes the image to lose its meaning or clarity, which causes people find a significant challenge to Correct and fix images.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As a consequence, many people have been trying to find ways to improve images quality. in order to restore an image, these flaws must be fixed in order to return it to its original, or at least visually appealing, state. As a result, our project aims to improve image resolution by using image processing methods.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Project goal:)
/E (Project goal:)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The primary goal of this project is to fix images using restoration techniques, to rejuvenate aging and damaged photographs , make them clearer.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We aim is to processing these images, enhancing clarity, removing noise, addressing imperfections and improving image quality. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
