/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The methodology for image contrast and sharpening involves two key techniques. Image contrast aims to improve visual quality by adjusting pixel intensities through methods such as histogram equalization. This technique enhance contrast and reveal more details. On the other hand, image sharpening techniques enhance edge and fine details, improving perceived sharpness. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
